Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.06,0:00:21.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宇宙海盗哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.76,0:02:17.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,东京120度4分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.62,0:02:19.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北纬38度30分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.02,0:02:22.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果地图没错应该在这一带
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.46,0:02:23.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,金字塔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.02,0:02:25.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,金字塔？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.39,0:02:34.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.06,0:02:39.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.22,0:02:41.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难怪雷达上什么都看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.06,0:02:45.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们终于都找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.56,0:02:47.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最终兵器就沉眠在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.06,0:02:55.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第十一话 砂之惑星 萨德斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.56,0:03:05.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.59,0:03:07.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们到那里都不得消停
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.62,0:03:09.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上空有宇宙船
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,PTM12型
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.72,0:03:16.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Side Winder！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.29,0:03:19.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是雪哥利亚的宇宙船
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.19,0:03:19.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.82,0:03:20.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雪哥利亚？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.56,0:03:33.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.36,0:03:37.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是谢谢你了\N特意带领我们到最终兵器的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:39.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个声音是珊德拉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:42.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.32,0:03:43.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太光荣了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.52,0:03:48.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才吓到了呢 居然在这地方遇见美女熟人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.26,0:03:50.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么找到我的？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.16,0:03:51.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是问交通警察吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.89,0:03:58.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多明尼克的耳垂埋有小型发讯机
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:01.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然，她本人不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.32,0:04:03.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.02,0:04:05.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.92,0:04:08.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直从鲁鲁斯星跟过来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.56,0:04:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错，我一直等待你们替我找到最终兵器
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.69,0:04:14.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今你们已没有利用价值了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.99,0:04:17.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.89,0:04:29.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要看不起我们！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.42,0:04:34.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这艘宇宙船的制造造费相当于一个宇宙舰队
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.19,0:04:39.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海龟号消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.92,0:04:41.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.56,0:04:47.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我们的后面！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.06,0:04:49.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不敢相信！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.49,0:04:50.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是用什么航法的？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.09,0:04:55.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊德拉老师 好像不知道反加速装置
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.02,0:04:59.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海龟号可以瞬间静止不动呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.86,0:05:04.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是你们把我们追过头了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.86,0:05:08.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了，现在换我出手吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.42,0:05:16.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,引擎被击中了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.66,0:05:17.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这艘船不能支撑了下去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.86,0:05:19.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立即着陆！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.26,0:05:25.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把Black Sheep放出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.82,0:05:52.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:56.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要让她给逃了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:03.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶，看不到它了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.96,0:06:07.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看，是珊德拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.46,0:06:08.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.46,0:06:10.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊德拉朝金字塔方向前进了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.59,0:06:22.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂，别让珊德拉进入金字塔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.26,0:06:23.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,IK！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.36,0:06:30.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Black Sheep!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.69,0:06:37.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开火！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.49,0:06:41.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是从哪里发射的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.06,0:06:42.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是从沙漠中发射的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.32,0:06:45.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法捕捉到确切的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.49,0:06:59.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里就是入口了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.62,0:07:13.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把沙子都轰开算了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.32,0:07:26.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.19,0:07:30.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直和地鼠游戏的话\N最终兵器会被珊德拉抢走的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.92,0:07:33.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要管它！现在就着陆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:33.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:53.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了，瑞蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:54.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剩下的就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.89,0:07:58.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等，我也要去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.89,0:07:59.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多明尼克
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.66,0:08:03.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不想哥普拉他分心的话\N就在这里等他回来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.29,0:08:14.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开火！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.42,0:08:19.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.42,0:08:23.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敌人档住入口还张开了护壁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.46,0:08:30.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,护壁的能源能支撑多久？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.59,0:08:31.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,20分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.69,0:08:32.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.96,0:08:35.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点时间足够哥普拉他办正事了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:37.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.09,0:09:00.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无重力空间啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.39,0:09:57.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷宫吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.39,0:09:59.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个我最拿手了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.66,0:10:05.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边！这边！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.46,0:10:08.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:11.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.69,0:10:13.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又回到原点了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.12,0:10:25.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么，钢琴弦？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.09,0:10:39.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.02,0:10:46.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在黑暗中你是不是能躲过钢琴线和我的电射枪呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.76,0:10:51.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个人感到寂寞了所以在等我来吗，珊德拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.76,0:10:52.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.06,0:10:55.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来当你的约会对像你不满意吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.99,0:10:59.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不，非常满意
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.50,0:11:14.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.65,0:11:31.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起了，哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.75,0:11:32.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约会结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:34.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须去死了!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.18,0:11:38.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:40.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好不容易才有气氛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:44.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.22,0:11:55.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是避雷针啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.18,0:11:56.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.18,0:12:18.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？开枪啊！珊德拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.62,0:12:41.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来是能源用尽了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:45.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次换我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:48.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.98,0:13:44.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.72,0:14:08.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国王的墓室到底在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.75,0:14:10.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用你的探测机帮我找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.52,0:14:28.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这边吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:53.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么多人骨！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.78,0:15:11.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.05,0:15:13.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是王的墓室！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.02,0:15:16.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是最终兵器的长眠处！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.15,0:15:33.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多贝尔，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.05,0:15:40.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么东西要来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.48,0:16:21.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,王家守护神和你的宠物之间的比试\N胜负快要分出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.35,0:16:33.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是太心急了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.68,0:16:38.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这时候不应该顾着我的\N应该多关心下你的宠物的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.48,0:17:01.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多贝尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.68,0:17:26.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？珊德拉，到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.25,0:17:28.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.08,0:17:29.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去帮你的宠物复仇吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.85,0:18:00.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊德拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.22,0:18:02.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你太卑鄙了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.18,0:18:16.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉 王室守护者就交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:29.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶！好不容易才来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.88,0:18:31.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对要把这门打开！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.32,0:19:10.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.98,0:19:17.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乱数记号式电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.18,0:19:19.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还是上世纪的旧机型
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.98,0:19:22.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太简单了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.15,0:20:14.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是王的墓室
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.72,0:20:16.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我终于找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.12,0:20:30.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.55,0:20:35.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么慢，我等了好久了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.42,0:20:37.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.22,0:20:38.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,单纯的偶然！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.68,0:20:43.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被守护者追着追着 不知不觉的就来到这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.42,0:20:44.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.35,0:20:45.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.52,0:20:47.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最终兵器在那里？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.72,0:20:52.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那真是太好笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.48,0:20:54.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.18,0:20:58.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些古代黄金，宝石，王冠
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.62,0:21:02.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,单单是没看到什么兵器的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.68,0:21:03.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.02,0:21:06.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能！但事实就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.18,0:21:11.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概有人先我们一步拿走了\N也只有这种可能性吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.55,0:21:13.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也只能这么想了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.28,0:21:18.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎样？现在再争斗也没用了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.45,0:21:21.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要将这些平分吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.18,0:21:24.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五五分帐足够做你的嫁装了\N这能让你轻松选婿，找个好男人！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.22,0:21:29.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看啊，这蓝宝石
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.22,0:21:31.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找遍银河系的话，也找不到可以媲美它的了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.55,0:21:36.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了，珊德拉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.72,0:21:40.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也差不多厌倦这种血腥的生活了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.82,0:21:41.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.18,0:21:44.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我就选这一个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.58,0:21:47.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也太不为自己着想了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.15,0:21:49.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你竟只要一个怪蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.35,0:21:53.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错，这个看起来像怪蛋的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:56.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.28,0:21:57.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.02,0:22:08.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.02,0:22:13.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是火星古代史的传说秘宝最终兵器！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.92,0:22:15.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.28,0:22:46.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最终兵器是一个长得稀奇古怪的蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.65,0:22:49.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它是让人进化的机器
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.95,0:22:53.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊德拉变成巨人来攻击我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.22,0:22:56.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是我也难于对付啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.12,0:22:57.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底要怎样做才好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.69,0:23:00.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一集\N恐怖的最终兵器
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.73,0:23:03.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
